{
  "file" : "npc/re/instances/HazyForest.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Are you going into the forest?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Well, well, well, aren't you being too rash?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Why don't you at least organize a party?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "...Are you sure you're not doing too much?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "I think you'd better get some rest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "You'll only wear yourself out by trying to do too much"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "I don't think the authority will give you permission, either."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "...Even a Sapha would be stopped from entering the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "You speak our language quite well, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "...Do I?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Actually I'm not speaking your language."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "I'm speaking Laphine language."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "But it's one of the mysteries of Bifrost."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "That we can understand each other even if we speak different languages."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "To be able to talk with everybody..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Perhaps that's the power of Bifrost."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Great, great."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Now the forest won't reject you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "What are you going to do now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "You human adventurers are incredible."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "You're always going into the forest, where no one else dares to go."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Phew. But I have to report to the authority"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "everyone who goes into the forest, just in case."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "[Laphine Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "You'll get permission"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "after you register."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Laphine Soldier",
      "text" : "Are you going to venture into the Hazy Forest?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
