      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 616,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "I understand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 617,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Step back if you aren't ready."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 618,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "This forest doesn't like strangers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 623,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 624,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "I told you - step back if you don't want to die."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 625,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "It's not easy going through the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 626,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "It may cost you your life."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 628,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Okay."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 628,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "What do you want?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 630,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "- When you step back,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 631,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Loki nods slightly and then looks away. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 634,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 635,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "I'm looking for somebody."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 636,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Have you ever seen a guard... a girl with purple hair?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 638,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "No, I haven't."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 638,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Yes, I might have..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 640,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 641,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "So you haven't."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 642,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "You're telling the truth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 646,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 647,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Wait."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 648,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "(Loki comes closer.)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 649,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "... No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 650,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "You're telling the truth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 654,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 655,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Now we have to say goodbye here."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 656,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Hopefully, we will see each other again in Mora."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 662,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 663,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "I don't want to go with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 664,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Hopefully, we will see each other again in Mora."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 667,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 668,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "So we meet again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 669,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Are you used to this place?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 670,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "Come to the inn in Mora."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 671,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "I have something to give to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 674,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 675,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "We're seeing a lot of each other these days."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 676,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "It seems you are completely comfortable with the place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 677,
      "npc" : "Mysterious Young Man",
      "text" : "You'd better not be too proud of yourself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 691,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 692,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "An adventurer in the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 693,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "....."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 694,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "You can go to Mora through this forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 697,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 698,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "Is it you that took care of this unruly girl?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 699,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I guess I have to thank you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 700,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "You've calmed her down."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 702,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "What's happening?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 702,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "This girl...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 703,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 704,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "You might be able to change your appearance, but you cannot change your unique, innate light."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 705,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "A scent strong enough to burn your nose."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 707,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 708,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "This is Nydhogg, the Guardian of Yggdrasil,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 709,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "whom I was looking for."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 710,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "Now she won't wander around crazy any more."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 712,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "What are you going to do now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 713,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 714,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I'll wait for her to wake up and get out of this forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 715,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I can manage it on my own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 716,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I'll see you in Mora."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 722,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 723,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I don't want to go with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 724,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I can manage her on my own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 725,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "If you have something to say, say it after we get out of the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 728,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 729,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "I don't want to go with you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 730,
      "npc" : "Loki",
      "text" : "If you have something to say, say it after we get out of the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 744,
      "npc" : "Collapsed Girl",
      "text" : "You see a girl with mysterious hair collapsed on the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 745,
      "npc" : "Collapsed Girl",
      "text" : "As you approach her, you smell the scent of flowers so strong that it makes you dizzy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 759,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Flower Smell Lady]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 760,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I need rest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 761,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I'm too tired to talk to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 762,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 765,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 766,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I've been waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 767,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I'm still confused, but I know what I did wrong."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 769,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 770,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "If it weren't for you, I would still be wandering in the abyssal darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 771,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I thank you, from the bottom of my heart."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 773,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 774,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I'm ashamed of myself, falling for the sweet but empty words that came to me in my loneliness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 775,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 777,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 778,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I don't deserve to be a guardian any more."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 779,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "A dragon gone crazy is not a guardian any more."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 781,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 782,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "Yggdrasil doesn't think so."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 783,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "Nidi, don't forget your duties."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 785,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 786,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "Are you...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 787,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I see..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 788,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I thought I was forsaken..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 790,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "The Guardian slowly looked away as if deep in thought."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 794,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "- He seems to be deep in thought. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 797,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 798,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I haven't gotten all of my powers back."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 799,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "I'm sorry I can't protect you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 801,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 802,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "Loki said..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 803,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "that I won't cry from loneliness again,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 804,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "that I will always have new friends like you..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 806,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 807,
      "npc" : "Flower Smelling Lady",
      "text" : "...I've lost everything, but I'm happy now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 814,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "- You have too many items to do this quest. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 818,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "He won't look at you. It's like he's not interested at all."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 821,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 822,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "So you've passed through the forest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 823,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "It seems Niddy has something to say to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 826,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 827,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "Nydhogg was one of the guardians of the World Tree."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 828,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "But he abandoned his duties as a guardian when he gave in to Morocc's temptation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 830,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 831,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "Some fools performed a ritual to break the seal that held Morocc."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 832,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "But the ritual didn't work right. The servant of Morocc failed to break the seal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 834,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 835,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "But the seal is so weak that it can break open any time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 836,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "It's Yggdrasil the World Tree's will that has kept the seal from breaking."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 838,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 839,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "That's right. The power of the World Tree is linked to the whole world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 840,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "When the bond between the guardians and Yggdrasil broke, Yggdrasil became unstable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 842,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 843,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "That's why all those disasters happened to Yggdrasil."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 844,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "As the World Tree became unstable, the influence it had on the seal grew weak."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 846,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Loki]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 847,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "And Morocc broke himself free from the seal."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 848,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "Although it seems like he used most of his powers just to break the seal..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 850,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 851,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "It's all my fault."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 852,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "I couldn't break free from Morocc's temptation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 853,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "For too... too long..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 855,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 856,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "...I wanted to be relieved of my thousands of years of loneliness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 857,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "I wasn't in my right mind then."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 858,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "It was none other than I that broke my bond with Yggdrasil."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 860,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 861,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "I lost control of myself, and did what I shouldn't have done."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 862,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "The other side of me became a shadow and a reckless tyrant."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 864,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "[Nydhogg the Guardian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 865,
      "npc" : "Sharp Eyed Man",
      "text" : "Facing the world, I realized..."
    },
    {
